	(text "Connectors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 204.47 28.448 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.556 3.556)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "001e2e11-9a38-4f4c-ba7e-13481aa7e13c")
	)
	(text "TPS54302 buck: VBUS_PD (5..20 V) -> +5V / 3 A. L 10 uH, Cout 2x22 uF,\nFB 100k/13.3k (Vref 0.596 V), Cff 75 pF. EN floats = enabled."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.022 47.752 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23792a67-34bf-4866-b114-7b92f6bc9800")
	)
	(text "Qwiic / Stemma QT ports.\nPorts 1-2 = bus A on +3V3_A, 3-4 = bus B on +3V3_B.\nLocal 4.7u + 100n per port, ESD on SDA/SCL,\npull-ups 3.3k once per bus on the BUS rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 305.054 55.626 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "257a98ab-284e-4e45-96c5-1072542ed252")
	)
	(text "I2C bus A rail: +5V -> SY6280 (Ilim 6800 / 10k = 0.68 A, EN pulled up = default ON)\n-> AP2114H-3.3 -> +3V3_A. The 0.68 A limit is the LDO thermal budget (1.15 W in SOT-223)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.226 173.482 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "25adb8db-e786-45f3-938d-2e9af9f4787c")
	)
	(text "USB-C source port for one USB module:\n5 V from the SY6280 (1.45 A),\nRp 22k from +5V = 1.5 A advertisement,\nCC1/CC2 -> 10k -> X035 PA3/PA4:\ndevice-present detect (VBUS off until a sink is seen),\nESD at the socket, 22 R series to the PIO-USB pins GP16/17\n(also routed to the mezzanine pads)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.888 52.832 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "475182d2-d7d6-4878-80bf-d49104e37641")
	)
	(text "USB host port supply: SY6280 load switch,\nIlim = 6800 / 4.7k = 1.45 A,\nEN pulled up = default ON"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 115.824 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "73e8091e-c0ec-4940-aa99-10abca89cf93")
	)
	(text "Power Rails & Power On/Off Switches"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 32.766 27.432 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.556 3.556)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7eabe52e-a642-4fe8-9a46-58cf5d81e02b")
	)
	(text "Bus pull-ups (3.3k, on the bus rail)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 217.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "96f72123-f198-4719-a563-35f747cfbc1c")
	)
	(text "MEZZ_PRESENT low = mezzanine takes the USB uplink\n→ X035 turns EN_USB off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.078 113.538 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a01cd74c-341f-40f8-a9ce-f34fc8912a19")
	)
	(text "Mezzanine contact pads (bottom, under the Pico),\nGrouped in 4 clusters:\n- High power path: 4x VBUS_PD + 4x GND (5 A), MEZZ_EN (enabled)\n- Pico USB host: D+/D-, 5V pass-thru, GND, MEZZ_PRESENT (USB used by MEZZ), MEZZ_FAULT\n- I2C: SDA/SCL, 3.3V pass-thru, GND\n- SPI: SCK/MISO/MOSI/CS, 5V pass-thru, MEZZ_IRQ interrupt to Pico, MEZZ_AIN (ADC reading)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.596 148.082 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e4550980-9c37-49bb-9247-e0677a5daf87")
	)
	(text "I2C bus B rail: +5V -> SY6280 (Ilim 6800 / 10k = 0.68 A, EN pulled up = default ON)\n-> AP2114H-3.3 -> +3V3_B. The 0.68 A limit is the LDO thermal budget (1.15 W in SOT-223)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.226 228.092 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e895e099-5e8e-463e-99d6-67ba0919358c")
	)
